# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上 CRLF 反复改动的噪声
# 2026-09-28 补：本机 system 级 core.autocrlf=true，与 LF blob 冲突会产生
# "git diff 为空却报 modified" 的幻影改动（repo_hygiene H8）；本文件显式钉住 eol=lf 以消除它。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按文本处理并保持 LF
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.cfg   text eol=lf
*.ini   text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf

# 二进制：不做任何转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
*.ogg   binary
*.flac  binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.pdf   binary